#. Scene label
#. screens: end_screen.tscn
msgid ""
"You did it! I'm proud of you! I hope you had fun.\n"
"\n"
"However I am very sorry that this is such a boring and uninspired win "
"screen. You deserve better and you will get better - in the full release.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, enjoy trying some of the harder difficulties, go spend "
"those Beanz on some upgrades and try out some different builds.\n"
"\n"
"If you had fun during this demo be sure to give it a wishlist or follow on "
"Steam - there's so much more to come!"
msgstr ""
"Ho has aconseguit! Estic orgullós de tu! Espero que t'ho hagis passat bé.\n"
"\n"
"Tanmateix, em sap molt greu que aquesta sigui una pantalla de victòria tan "
"avorrida i poc inspirada. Et mereixes més i ho tindràs a la versió "
"completa.\n"
"\n"
"Mentrestant, gaudeix provant algunes de les dificultats més altes, ves a "
"gastar aquests Beanz en algunes millores i prova diferents construccions.\n"
"\n"
"Si t'ho has passat bé durant aquesta demo, no dubtis a afegir-la a la teva "
"llista de desitjos o a seguir-la a Steam: encara queda molt més per venir!"

